IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GLM-FET-LINK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 D1-ACCUMULATOR-CHARGE.
   05 D1-INITIAL-MU-CHARGE PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
   05 D1-DISCHARGE-DECAY   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 D2-GLM-LINK-POTENTIAL.
   05 D2-ETA-POTENTIAL     PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D2-RECONSTRUCTED-MU  PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 1000000 TO D1-INITIAL-MU-CHARGE.
    MOVE 50 TO D1-DISCHARGE-DECAY.

    PERFORM EVAL-GLM-LINK-FORWARD.
    PERFORM EVAL-GLM-LINK-INVERSE.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D2-ETA-POTENTIAL < D1-INITIAL-MU-CHARGE AND D2-RECONSTRUCTED-MU == D1-INITIAL-MU-CHARGE
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

EVAL-GLM-LINK-FORWARD.
    comment Forward Link Function: eta = g(mu) = (7/8 * mu) / (1 + decay);
    COMPUTE D2-ETA-POTENTIAL = (D1-INITIAL-MU-CHARGE * 875) / (1000 + D1-DISCHARGE-DECAY).
    EXIT.

EVAL-GLM-LINK-INVERSE.
    comment Exact Inverse Link Recovery: mu = g^-1(eta) = (eta * (1 + decay)) / (7/8);
    COMPUTE D2-RECONSTRUCTED-MU = (D2-ETA-POTENTIAL * (1000 + D1-DISCHARGE-DECAY)) / 875.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-ETA-POTENTIAL - ((D2-ETA-POTENTIAL / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
